### ==========================================
### ORGANIZER & CREATOR PORTAL REQUESTS
### ==========================================

### 1. Submit New Organizer Verification (KYC)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{organizerToken}}

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "orgId": {{orgId}},
  "entityType": "individual",
  "legalFullName": "John Doe Kamau",
  "idFrontUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80",
  "idBackUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544717305-2782549b5136?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80",
  "selfiePhotos": [
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
  ],
  "businessDocUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450133064473-71024230f91b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80",
  "taxCertUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366216548-37526070297c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
}


### ==========================================
### SHARED / LOOKUP REQUESTS
### ==========================================

### 3. Get Verification by User Digital ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: {{organizerToken}}

### 4. Get Verification by Organization ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/organization/{{orgId}}
Authorization: {{organizerToken}}


### ==========================================
### ADMIN REVIEW & DASHBOARD REQUESTS
### ==========================================

### 2. Get Verification Record by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}
token:  token={{adminToken}}

### 5. Get All Verifications (With Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}?limit=10&offset=0
token:  token={{adminToken}}

### 6. Get Verifications Filtered by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status/pending
token:  token={{adminToken}}

### 7. Get Verifications Filtered by Entity Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/entity/individual
token:  token={{adminToken}}

### 8. Update General Verification Details (Organizer)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{organizerToken}}

{
  "legalFullName": "John Doe Updated"
}

### 9. Update Global Review Status (Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
token:  token={{adminToken}}

{
  "status": "in_progress",
  "adminComment": "Review has started by compliance team."
}

### 10. Fully Approve Organizer Verification
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json
token:  token={{adminToken}}

{
  "adminComment": "All compliance checks passed successfully."
}

### 11. Globally Reject Verification
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json
token:  token={{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "Provided identification documents are fraudulent or blurry."
}

### 12. Request General Resubmission
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}/request-resubmission
Content-Type: application/json
token:  token={{adminToken}}

{
  "generalComment": "Please re-upload clearer documents."
}

### 13. Itemized Rejection: Front ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}/reject-field/id-front
Content-Type: application/json
token:  token={{adminToken}}

{
  "comment": "Front ID corners are cut off. Please retake photo."
}

### 14. Itemized Rejection: Back ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}/reject-field/id-back
Content-Type: application/json
token:  token={{adminToken}}

{
  "comment": "Back ID text is unreadable."
}

### 15. Itemized Rejection: Selfies
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}/reject-field/selfies
Content-Type: application/json
token:  token={{adminToken}}

{
  "comment": "Live selfie does not match ID photo clearly."
}

### 16. Itemized Rejection: Business Document
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}/reject-field/business-doc
Content-Type: application/json
token:  token={{adminToken}}

{
  "comment": "Business certificate registration number is expired."
}

### 17. Itemized Rejection: Tax Certificate
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}/reject-field/tax-cert
Content-Type: application/json
token:  token={{adminToken}}

{
  "comment": "KRA tax compliance certificate is invalid."
}

### 18. Clear Itemized Rejection on Re-upload (Organizer)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}/clear-rejection
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{organizerToken}}

{
  "field": "idFront",
  "newUrlValue": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
}

### 19. Get Count of Pending Verifications (Admin Metric)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/pending-count
token:  token={{adminToken}}

### 20. Get All Verifications Awaiting Resubmission Review
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/needing-resubmission
token:  token={{adminToken}}

### 21. Delete Verification Record (Admin Cleanup)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{verificationId}}
token:  token={{adminToken}}